WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
Fox News obtained a photograph of the dispatch order

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.400
sent out after Border Patrol agents called in

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.000
that they were under attack.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.320
The police department issued a statement yesterday

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.380
trying to walk the order back,

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.040
saying CPD officers did, in fact,

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.480
respond to that shooting scene

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.879
involving federal authorities on Saturday

00:00:19.879 --> 00:00:22.480
to maintain public safety and traffic control.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.559
However, two police sources told Fox News that's not true.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:29.879
Two suspects were arrested for allegedly ramming their cars

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:34.400
into a CBP vehicle, and DHS says one suspect was flagged

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.400
in an intelligence bulletin last week

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.480
for threatening agents.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.119
This weekend, she allegedly sideswiped an agent's car

00:00:41.119 --> 00:00:43.040
and was carrying a gun.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.799
That agent, unable to escape, shot and injured her.

00:00:46.799 --> 00:00:47.759
Before we go further,

00:00:47.759 --> 00:00:51.560
I wanna start with this first situation, Douglas.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.520
We are in what we might call,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.680
and some others have, an assassination culture.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:59.080
And so when you put people in danger

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.000
and you cause a no-go zone

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.980
around going to help agents or law enforcement,

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:07.760
you're creating a perfect scene for someone to be killed.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.519
Oh yeah, and it's been happening for years, this.

00:01:10.519 --> 00:01:12.400
I mean, we've been talking in recent weeks,

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.879
understandably, about the assassination culture,

00:01:14.879 --> 00:01:16.800
the culture of encouraging political violence

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.800
in this country.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.720
I don't think that anyone has been more consistently

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.919
on the receiving end of threats of violence

00:01:22.919 --> 00:01:25.720
than ICE agents in this country.

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:27.080
I've seen it with my own eyes.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:31.199
In 2020, I was undercover with Antifa in Portland,

00:01:31.199 --> 00:01:33.400
and I just saw the way they were behaving

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.919
towards the ICE agents.

00:01:34.919 --> 00:01:38.760
They try to burn them alive in their buildings.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.760
They set light to dumpster trucks

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:43.360
and wheel them into the doors in the hope they can't get out.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:46.519
Now we have routinely the doxing of anyone who's ICE agents,

00:01:46.519 --> 00:01:48.279
ICE agents having to cover their faces

00:01:48.279 --> 00:01:50.400
for fear of retribution,

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:54.559
hit lists out online with bounties on the heads of agents.

00:01:54.559 --> 00:01:56.839
I mean, this is obscene.

00:01:57.599 --> 00:01:59.959
This should not be happening in this country.

00:01:59.959 --> 00:02:02.000
These are federal employees.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.040
Well, and not only the masking situation,

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.559
you've got the governor of California

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.119
saying, take the masks off.

00:02:08.119 --> 00:02:10.679
So you've got them trying to protect themselves,

00:02:10.679 --> 00:02:12.199
and the governor of a large state

00:02:12.199 --> 00:02:14.199
that has a lot of illegal aliens

00:02:14.199 --> 00:02:16.240
who are committing crimes in his state,

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.600
wanting to protect the criminals

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:20.119
over the people who've gone to take back order.

00:02:20.119 --> 00:02:22.800
It's unfathomable, and I'm glad you bring up 2020

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.479
as they attempted to light that courthouse on fire in Portland.

00:02:25.479 --> 00:02:28.600
The emergency motion that DOJ filed the Ninth Circuit

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:31.160
to reverse the order of the district court judge

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:32.000
there in Portland,

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.679
saying you can't deploy the National Guard.

00:02:33.679 --> 00:02:35.559
And when you get to page six, listen to this.

00:02:35.559 --> 00:02:36.720
They're still doing it, Douglas.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.199
Protestors repeatedly tried to burn down

00:02:39.199 --> 00:02:40.360
the Portland ICE office.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:44.080
One protestor lit a flame, set fire to materials.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:47.479
The mob then piled on additional tender

00:02:47.479 --> 00:02:48.919
attempting to stoke the flames.

00:02:48.919 --> 00:02:50.639
That's just one of several incidents

00:02:50.639 --> 00:02:52.360
the government points to.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.240
And then you have the situation that is,

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.320
I just can't even wrap my mind around.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:59.440
Portland police not allowed to go into this bubble.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:02.199
There's two liaison officers on either side,

00:03:02.199 --> 00:03:03.759
and then they go into the bubble

00:03:03.759 --> 00:03:06.240
to arrest Nick Sorter, conservative journalist,

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.639
for doing nothing according to him.

00:03:08.639 --> 00:03:10.279
But don't go in to stop this kind of stuff.

00:03:10.279 --> 00:03:12.479
This is why President Trump has to step in.

00:03:12.479 --> 00:03:13.679
And just, I would say this,

00:03:13.679 --> 00:03:15.479
you know, I spoke on Saturday,

00:03:15.479 --> 00:03:18.119
Saturday in America with Tom Homan.

00:03:18.119 --> 00:03:20.399
And I said to Tom, what's happening in Portland,

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:22.320
the stand down of the police that we're seeing,

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:23.639
is it happening in Chicago?

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.520
And this was right before this incident happened.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:29.839
And he said to me, Chicago, New York, Portland,

00:03:29.839 --> 00:03:31.720
it's not the rank and file police officers.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:33.399
They want to do their job.

00:03:33.399 --> 00:03:35.279
It is the Democratic lawmakers on top

00:03:35.279 --> 00:03:37.160
creating this dangerous situation.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.119
Well, and if you do eventually have to send in

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:41.639
law enforcement officers,

00:03:41.639 --> 00:03:43.720
you've endangered everybody's life at that point.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.479
Because now they're walking into something

00:03:45.479 --> 00:03:47.199
that's already cooking with gas.

00:03:47.199 --> 00:03:48.119
Well, absolutely, Harris.

00:03:48.119 --> 00:03:50.080
And for those opposing what ICE is doing,

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.699
what's the alternative?

00:03:51.699 --> 00:03:55.300
Just allow terrorists, cartel members,

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.580
child predators to remain in America?

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:58.580
I mean, is that what these mayors

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.179
and these governors are advocating for?

00:04:00.179 --> 00:04:01.779
I mean, essentially it is.

00:04:01.779 --> 00:04:04.059
And Douglas, I'm glad you mentioned the bounty story.

00:04:04.059 --> 00:04:06.059
I was co-hosting Fox & Friends yesterday

00:04:06.059 --> 00:04:09.440
when Secretary Nome broke that news.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.380
She said some of our ICE agents and officers

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.699
have bounties put out for their heads,

00:04:12.699 --> 00:04:15.259
2,000 to kidnap, 10,000 to kill.

00:04:15.259 --> 00:04:16.899
Their pictures are being sent around networks.

00:04:16.899 --> 00:04:18.059
And I asked her the follow-up question,

00:04:18.059 --> 00:04:19.459
well, who's behind it?

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:21.500
You know, who is funding these bounties?

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:24.859
And she said cartels and terrorist organizations.

00:04:24.859 --> 00:04:26.739
And she said they're working on a whole-of-government

00:04:26.739 --> 00:04:28.779
approach along with the Treasury Department

00:04:28.779 --> 00:04:31.420
to try to get to the bottom of who's funding these riots.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:33.899
She said she was in Chicago just a couple of days ago.

00:04:33.899 --> 00:04:35.179
They all have the same masks.

00:04:35.179 --> 00:04:37.619
They all have the same signs.

00:04:37.619 --> 00:04:39.500
And so inevitably, we know we have

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.459
a domestic terrorism problem because that's essentially

00:04:41.459 --> 00:04:43.019
what is happening in these cities.

00:04:43.019 --> 00:04:44.899
They're using violence to try to change

00:04:44.899 --> 00:04:47.660
our government's approach, government policy.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.459
But how much overlap is there with foreign terrorism?

00:04:50.459 --> 00:04:52.179
And I think with some of these investigations,

00:04:52.179 --> 00:04:53.619
hopefully we get to the bottom of that.

00:04:53.619 --> 00:04:55.660
Yeah, I want to go back for just a second.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:58.380
Illinois Governor JB Pritzker dismissed the danger

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:00.579
that agents are facing.

00:05:00.579 --> 00:05:03.100
His state has filed a lawsuit against the Trump

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:05.140
administration for deploying the National Guard.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:07.179
Let's watch.

